OL,3,GNEWSARapist who attacked women while
OL,4,Athey were asleep or in pain jailed for
OL,5,A10 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has been jailed for 10 years for
OL,8,Fraping three women, including while one
OL,9,Fwoman was asleep.
OL,11,FLiam Scott, from Walkerburn in the
OL,12,FScottish Borders, was found guilty of
OL,13,Ffive charges of rape between 2015 and
OL,14,F2019.
OL,16,FThe High Court in Edinburgh heard how
OL,17,Fthe 28-year-old also used intimidation,
OL,18,Faggression and physical violence during
OL,19,Fthe attacks, and that he "took
OL,20,Fadvantage" of women when they were in
OL,21,Fpain or exhausted.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
