OL,3,GNEWSARapist who attacked women while
OL,4,Athey were asleep or in pain jailed for
OL,5,A10 years
OL,6,
OL,7,FDuring sentencing, judge Lord Harrower
OL,8,Fsaid Scott "consistently" prioritised
OL,9,Fhis own sexual gratification over any
OL,10,Fconcern for the wellbeing of the women.
